FILE     fbm98.nc (from line 1)
DIALECT  series 0 (given)
L2     NC     G20
L3     SET    #1 = 0.
L4     CALL   M98 O100 x3
L8     SET    #1 = 1.
L9     AGAIN  the call repeats
L8     SET    #1 = 2.
L9     AGAIN  the call repeats
L8     SET    #1 = 3.
L9     RET
L5     NC     G0 X3.
L6     NC     M30
END    M30
NOTE     -w FILE writes the DX32 program (features/FB2DX.md)
RESULT   ok
